 "insight": [
  "In 2025, the main product chapters in Luxembourg's exports were machinery and mechanical appliances, plastics and articles thereof, and vehicles and parts.",
  "Total exports reached 16.25 billion euros, with the top three product chapters accounting for 31.8% of this value.",
  "Machinery and mechanical appliances was the largest export category at 2.04 billion euros, representing 12.5% of total exports.",
  "Other products made up 31.1% of exports, while confidential exports accounted for 0.6%.",
  "The values are nominal and not adjusted for price changes, and 1.8% of the export value is confidential at full product detail."
